Official library containing the [URL="https://www.esoui.com/downloads/info1617-FurnitureCatalogue.html"]FurnitureCatalogue[/URL] database. Currently bundled in FurnitureCatalogue, starting with 7.0.0


The bundled lib will disappear after a while and then this one will be required to load FurnitureCatalogue.


Offers API endpoints for other AddOns. Instructions will follow.


I set it to beta, because I don't want it showing up in the regular lists yet, but it is identical with the bundled version and can already be used.


This description will be more useful in the future, I swear.


Details:
https://github.com/manavortex/FurnitureCatalogue/issues/196


LFC repo: https://github.com/wookiefriseur/LFC
